    <body>
(Nama dia [NAMA].) <segment id='7' features='eror;leksikal;kata;ktvar' state='active'>Dia <segment id='1' features='eror;ejaan;ejhrf' state='active' parent='7'>purempuan</segment>. Dia berwajah cantik. Rambutnya pendek. Rambutnya berwarna <segment id='2' features='eror;ejaan;ejhrf' state='active' parent='7'>cokolat</segment> dan hitam. Dia berkacamata <segment id='3' features='eror;ejaan;ejhrf' state='active' parent='7'>cokolat</segment>. Dia memakai <segment id='4' features='eror;leksikal;kata;ktas' state='active' parent='7'>mask</segment> dan warna <segment id='5' features='eror;gramatikal;frasa-nomina;nyaitu' state='active' parent='7'>itu</segment> putih.</segment> Tinggi badan dia rata-rata. Dia <segment id='6' features='eror;gramatikal;frasa-nomina;nom0' state='active'>bertinggi 158.2</segment>.
<segment id='12' features='eror;leksikal;kata;ktvar' state='active'>Dia memakai <segment id='10' features='eror;ejaan;ejhrf' state='active' parent='12'>kaos</segment> putih dan jaket hijau. Dia tidak memakai <segment id='8' features='eror;ejaan;ejhrf' state='active' parent='12'>giwan</segment>. Dia juga tidak memakai <segment id='9' features='eror;ejaan;ejsp' state='active' parent='12'>jamtangan</segment>. Dia memakai celana kotak-kotak. Dia memakai kaus kaki hitam.</segment> Sepatunya berwarna putih. <segment id='11' features='eror;ejaan;ejhrf' state='active' correction='Kancing'>Pancink</segment> yang ada di baju dia besar dan berwarna hijau. Tangannya lebih kecil daripada tangan saya. Ukuran <segment id='13' features='eror;gramatikal;frasa-nomina;nya0' state='active'>sepatu</segment> lebih kecil <segment id='14' features='eror;gramatikal;frasa-nomina;nom0' state='active'>daripada saya</segment>. Sepatunya berukuran 23.5. Tahi <segment id='15' features='eror;ejaan;ejhrf' state='active'>lala</segment> ada di <segment id='16' features='eror;gramatikal;frasa-nomina;urtfn' state='active'>kanan leher</segment> dan <segment id='17' features='eror;gramatikal;frasa-nomina;urtfn' state='active'><segment id='19' features='eror;gramatikal;frasa-nomina;nya0' state='active' parent='17'>tangan <segment id='18' features='eror;leksikal;kata;noms' state='active' correction='pergelangan' parent='19'>leher</segment></segment></segment>. Alisnya tipis dan hitam. Dia bermata <segment id='20' features='eror;ejaan;ejhrf' state='active'>cokolat</segment>. Telinga dia kecil. Hidungnya <segment id='21' features='eror;leksikal;kata;adjs' state='active' correction='mancung'>tinggi</segment>. Bibirnya <segment id='22' features='eror;ejaan;ejhrf' state='active'>tebak</segment>. Dia duduk.
Dia memakai <segment id='23' features='eror;leksikal;kata;ktas' state='active'>smartphone</segment>, <segment id='24' features='eror;leksikal;kata;ktas' state='active'>pencil</segment>, penghapus, <segment id='26' features='eror;ejaan;ejtb' state='active'><segment id='25' features='eror;leksikal;kata;ktas' state='active' parent='26'>PC</segment> dan</segment> kamus besar. <segment id='27' features='eror;leksikal;kata;ktas' state='active'>Pencil</segment> dan <segment id='28' features='eror;leksikal;kata;ktas' state='active'>smartphone</segment> dia berwarna biru. <segment id='29' features='eror;leksikal;kata;konjs' state='active' correction='Jadi'>Untuk itu</segment>, dia terlihat suka warna biru.
Dia terlihat lelah. Agaknya dia ada di sekolah dan <segment id='31' features='eror;leksikal;kata;vrbs' state='active' correction='mendapat'>berakhir</segment> banyak <segment id='30' features='eror;ejaan;ejhrf' state='active'>pekerjakaan</segment> rumah. Dia sering berbicara dengan saya. <segment id='32' features='eror;ejaan;ejtb' state='active'>Jadi dia</segment> terlihat <segment id='33' features='eror;gramatikal;frasa-preposisi;prep0' state='active'>suka saya</segment>.    </body>
